FORMAT: 1A
HOST: https://rest.fizzpa.net/api

# Fizzpa
Fizzpa API allows you to connect your website or application with Fizzpa to provide adding , read/update orders information and content, etc.

## Authentication [/Auth]

### me [GET/Auth/me]
Use this method to Get user profile 

+ Request (application/json)

    + Headers

            Authorization: <your key>
            Referer:<URL>
            
+ Response 200 (application/json)

    + Body
    
