### Add a new order [POST]

Use this method to add new orders to fizzpa

    
+ Request (application/json)

    + Attributes
        + SenderPhone: 966500000000 (required, string) - Sender Phone
        + SenderName: james bond (required, string) - Sender Name
        + SenderEmail: abc@fizzpa.net (optional, string) - Sender email address
        + SenderCityId: 1 (required, number) - you can download [Cities List](https://fizzpa.net/Cities.xlsx) Riyadh = 1
        + SenderAddress: شارع الأمير عبدالرحمن ، حي المربع  12626 (required, string) -  Sender Address
        + SenderNeighborhood: حطين (optional, string) - Sender Neighborhood
        + SenderLatitude: 24.778463 (optional, number) - Sender Latitude
        + SenderLongitude: 24.778463 (optional, number) - Sender Longitude
        + SenderNationalAddress: RAHA3443  (optional, string) - Sender National Address
        + RecipientCityId: 1 (required, number) - you can download [Cities List](https://fizzpa.net/Cities.xlsx) Riyadh = 1  
        + RecipientName: john wick (required, string) - Recipient Name
        + RecipientPhone1: 966500000000  (required, string) - recipient phone1 in 966500000000  format
        + RecipientPhone2: 966500000000  (optional, string) - recipient phone1 in 966500000000  format
        + RecipientAddress: شارع الأمير عبدالرحمن ، حي المربع  12626 (required, string) -  Recipient Address
        + RecipientNeighborhood:  حي المربع   (optional, string) - Recipient Neighborhood
        + RecipientLatitude:  24.77839110   (optional, number) - Recipient Latitude
        + RecipientLongitude:  46.72053130   (optional, number) - Recipient Longitude
        + RecipientNationalAddress: RAHA3443  (optional, string) - Recipient National Address
        + RecipientEmail: info@fizzpa.net (optional,string) - Recipient email address
        + OrderRef: I-001 (optional, string) - Order reference could be purchasing invoice number
        + OrderNote: order notes (optional, string) - Any note related to order
        + CodAmount: 100 (required, number) - If Not Cash on delivery put it 0
        + OrderPiecesCount: 2 (required, number) - Pieces Count
        + OrderTotalWeight: 1.5   (optional, number) - Order Total Weight 
    + Headers

            Authorization: <your key>
            Referer:<URL>
        
    + Body       
    
            {
            "SenderPhone":"966500000000",
            "SenderName":"james bond",
            "SenderCityId":1,
            "SenderAddress":"Address in detailes",
            "SenderNeighborhood":"Sender Neighborhood",
            "SenderLatitude":0,
            "SenderLongitude":0,
            "RecipientCityId": 1,
            "RecipientName":"john wick",
            "RecipientPhone1":"966500000000",
            "RecipientNeighborhood":"حي المربع",
            "RecipientAddress":"Address in detailes",
            "OrderRef":"I-001",
            "CodAmount":100,
            "OrderPiecesCount":1
            }

 
        
+ Response 200 (application/json)

    + Body

            {
            "success": true,
            "message": "saved successfully",
            "OrderId": 15202016,
            "CompanyId": 15,
            "AgentId": 20192,
            "CustomerId": "966542457766",
            "RecipientId": 1885,
            "OrderRef": "I-001",
            "labelId": "https://fizzpa.net/pdf/bdb8ddaf-dee1-4504-9559-1d8d0bbea899.pdf"
            }
            

### Delete Order [DELETE/orders/{orderid}]
Use this method to Delete Order if not picked up.
+ Parameters
    + orderid: 5562564 (number,required) - An unique identifier of the order.
+ Request (application/json)

    + Headers
    
            Authorization: <your key>
            Referer:<URL>
            
+ Response 200 (application/json)

     + Body
     
            {
                "success": true,
                "Message":"Deleted successfully"
            }

### Print order [GET/orders/label/{orderid}/{lingo}/{size}]
Use this method to Print labels
+ Parameters
    + orderid: 5562564 (number,required) - An unique identifier of the order.
    + lingo: ar (required, string) - language ar or en.
    + size: A4 (required, string) - label size A4 or A6.
       
       

+ Request (application/json)

    + Headers
    
            Authorization: <your key>
            Referer:<URL>
            
+ Response 200 (application/json)
    

            
## Tracking [/Tracking]
### Get order [GET/Tracking/{orderid}]
Use this method to track your order in  fizzpa 
+ Parameters
    + orderid: 5562564 (number,required) - An unique identifier of the order.

+ Request (application/json)

    + Headers

            Authorization: <your key>
            Referer:<URL>
            
+ Response 200 (application/json)

     + Body
     
            [
                {
                    "Trackid": 11042,
                    "OrderId": 15202016,
                    "CompanyId": 00,
                    "TrackingStatus": 2,
                    "WhereIN": "At Shop",
                    "Note": "Shipping company confirm shipping order",
